      "expectation": "Reports a review (UNTESTED) instead of a pass or fail when the contrast cannot\nbe measured: glyphs painted transparent over a gradient (background-clip:\ntext), no resolvable colour, or the text covered by a fixed/sticky overlay\nsuch as a cookie banner (the overlay's own text is measurable and not\nreported). Over an image or gradient that can be sampled, a median that\npasses with a 40th percentile that fails is a borderline review under this\nid as well. Text on a solid background never produces this finding. It is\nnever a confirmed violation.",
